            <ArticleTitle>Glomus vagale: an unusual presentation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1205-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An unusual case of glomus vagale tumour is presented where severe pain was a predominant feature. The pathological and clinical features of this rare tumour are reviewed and the investigations and treatment are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
